 3. Exclusive: How small businesses really use AI 
 
 By Herb Scribner 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: Goldman Sachs; Chart: Erin Davis/Axios Small businesses across America are embracing AI, but usage and spending vary dramatically by state, according to exclusive Goldman Sachs data shared with Axios.

 By the numbers: The survey of 2,474 small business owners who graduated from or participated in Goldman Sachs' 10,000 Small Businesses program found 86% of program graduates use AI in their workplaces.

